abstract: "Independent student project, written as a supporting tool for coursework at Chalmers University of Technology. Distance-based 100 km mission cycles and a backward powertrain model give the fuel, hydrogen or electricity used every 10 m by a Swedish timber truck, an urban bus and a coach."
